29. In the judgment passed in the case of Union of India vs. Steel Authority of India Ltd.;
MANU/AP/1039/2004, the Andhra Pradesh High Court, after taking note of remark on the Railway receipt i.e. S/C ('said to contain') as also the fact that 'loading was not supervised by Railway staff',
allowed the appeal and order of Tribunal favourable to the claimant was set aside.
